              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="9">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Geometry is assumed to be given in [m]. Creates beams with default properties from given lines. Lines that meet at a common point are thus connected with each other. Karamba3D assumes input to be in [m].</item>
